  "specification": "SPEC-OSA v1.1 AC-020 ratchet, started in Stage 1: per module and family, counts may only fall.",
  "baseline": "benchmarks/osa/inventory.json (Stage 0, d7a976821). A ceiling above its Stage 0 count needs a named exception below.",
  "lockIn": "node scripts/osa-inventory.mjs --ratchet rewrites the ceilings with the current counts; run it when a count falls.",
  "exempt": "src/kernel/ is the decision owner and holds no counted site by design.",
